WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.159
A few numbers summarize the impact.

00:00:02.239 --> 00:00:07.851
Up to ninety-nine-point-four percent of target
nodes have perturbations that change their

00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:10.345
true label under a common threat model.

00:00:10.425 --> 00:00:16.421
A perfectly robust classifier shows forty-three
percent over-robustness at low signal strength.

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:21.346
Label propagation cuts a GCN's over-robustness to
roughly twenty-one percent,

00:00:21.426 --> 00:00:26.463
and even under the strong Nettack attack
over-robustness never fully disappears,

00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:30.620
sitting around eleven to nineteen percent depending
on the model.
